      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>These lists are used as simple data stores for the Hyperborea system. They are used to populate drop-down lists in the Class Template sheet and elsewhere. <em>Do not edit these lists.</em></p><p>If you want to add a custom item of any type and use it in a class template, all you need to do is create the Item document in your world Items directory (in an appropriate folder) so that the system can find it.</p>"
      },
